  │     9   ## 3. Simple Translation                                                                                                                                                    [38;2;108;112;134m│
  │    10 - Release the frozen money                                                                                                                                                    │
  │    10 + top spot                                                                                                                                                                    │
  │    11                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    12   ## 4. Key Vocabulary                                                                                                                                                        │
  │    13                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    14   | Word / Phrase | Meaning | Example Sentence |                                                                                                                              │
  │    15   |---|---|---|                                                                                                                                                               [38;2;108;112;134m│
  │    16 - | unfreeze | 解凍（解除資金或帳戶的限制） | The bank agreed to unfreeze the account after verification. |                                                                   │
  │    17 - | funds | 資金、款項 | The funds will be available within three business days. |                                                                                            │
  │    18 - | release | 釋放、解開（限制） | They plan to release the frozen assets next week. |                                                                                        │
  │    19 - | frozen assets | 凍結的資產 | The court ordered the frozen assets to be returned. |                                                                                        │
  │    16 + | dominant position | 主導地位、霸主地位 | The company holds a dominant position in the smartphone market. |                                                                │
  │    17 + | hegemony | 霸權、霸主地位 | Their economic hegemony shaped global trade for decades. |                                                                                    │
  │[39m    18 + | supremacy | 至高無上的地位、霸權 | The two giants are battling for tech supremacy. |                                                                                      │
  │    19 + | top spot | 龍頭位置、第一名 | They overtook their rival to claim the top spot. |                                                                                          │
  │    20                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    21   ## 5. Useful Sentence Pattern                                                                                                                                               │
  │    22                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    23   **Pattern:**                                                                                                                                                                │
  │    24 - The bank will ___ the funds once ___.                                                                                                                                       [38;2;108;112;134m│
  │    24 + to hold / secure / maintain a dominant position in ___                                                                                                                      │
  │    25                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    26   **Example:**                                                                                                                                                                │
  │    27 - The bank will release the funds once the documents are approved.                                                                                                            │
  │    27 + Apple has maintained a dominant position in the wearable market for years.                                                                                                  │
  │    28                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    29   ## 6. Speaking Version                                                                                                                                                      │
  │    30 - We're unlocking the money now. / The funds are available again.                                                                                                             │
  │    30                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    31 + They're at the top — nobody can touch their number one spot right now.                                                                                                      │
  │    [38;2;108;112;134m32 +                                                                                                                                                                             │
  │    33   ## 7. Common Mistake                                                                                                                                                        │
  │    34                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    34 - Don't say: "thaw the money."                                                                                                                                                │
  │    35 - Say: "unfreeze the funds" or "release the funds."                                                                                                                           │
  │    35 + Don't say: "boss status" or "overlord position" when you mean a market leader.                                                                                              │
  │    36 + Say: "dominant position" or "market leadership" — these are the natural English terms for 霸主地位 in business contexts.                                                    │
  │    37                                                                                                                                                                               │
  │    37 - > "Thaw" is used for ice, meat, or frozen food — not for money. In finance we use "unfreeze" or "release."                                                                  │
  │    38 -                                                                                                                                                                             │
